the First Impression rose,

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:29.434
but he's working his way towards
an invite to the Fantasy Suite.

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:31.267
You know what I'm saying?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:33.167
